WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:11.313
This video shows how a teacher or admin records the monthly skill and behaviour assessment on a phone. You choose the class, rate a student, write a remark and save the month.

00:00:12.981 --> 00:00:21.549
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Academics, and then choose Assessments. The page is called Monthly Assessments.

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:35.050
Choose the class, here Class 1 - A. The month is already set to the current month. Every student in the class appears as a card, with skill and behaviour ratings and a teacher remark.

00:00:35.512 --> 00:00:47.704
On the first card, tap Listening and choose Good. Then tap Discipline under Behaviour and choose Excellent. Tap the Teacher remark box and write a short note about the student.

00:01:06.779 --> 00:01:15.803
Go back to the top and tap Save Month. This saves the whole class at once, and a message tells you how many assessments were saved.

00:01:28.518 --> 00:01:34.230
The month is saved. The latest saved month shows on the student report.
